"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":-100000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When the leshy husk hits an enemy with its blighted seedpod, the creature must make a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:16|name:Draining Impact DC|traits:primal, damaging-effect|showDC:gm]{Fortitude} save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and becomes immune to the leshy's draining impact for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes [[/r 1d4[void]]] damage. The leshy husk recovers Hit Points equal to the negative damage dealt.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"4xVYSUvk00q9vHX4","name":"Change Shape","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The leshy husk turns into a Small dead tree or tree detritus (such as a fallen log). This ability otherwise uses the effects of <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu]{Tree Shape}</em>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ChangeShape]</p>"},"ru